    "ss_flip_cards_2_w3rKfJ": {
      "type": "ss-flip-cards-2",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MeMVCt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "| A - C"
          }
        },
        "card_eq6C7L": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb24_vase-acrobat4-small.webp",
            "title": "Acrobat",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the strength and poise of the human form, the Acrobat Collection captures a moment of graceful motion in sculptural décor. Its elongated lines and expressive balance create a striking, gymnastic silhouette that elevates modern interiors. Refined and contemporary, the range blends artistry with function, bringing movement and Carrol Boyes’ signature sculptural sophistication into the home.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Decor</p><p><a href=\"/collections/acrobat\" title=\"Acrobat\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_FcxE9T": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb22_secondaryimages_allure2_1.webp",
            "title": "Allure",
            "text": "<p>Defined by clean lines and contemporary refinement, the Allure Collection brings minimalist elegance to the table. Crafted from high-quality 18/8 stainless steel with a radiant mirror polish, each piece features a sleek, elongated silhouette embodying understated luxury. Balanced, modern and effortlessly sophisticated, the range elevates everyday dining through sculptural simplicity and timeless Carrol Boyes design.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/allure\" title=\"Allure\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_x3QNym": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb18_aster-and-tamarillo-tomato.webp",
            "title": "Aster",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the joyful bloom of the aster flower, the Aster Collection adds whimsical charm to the table. Mirror-polished stainless steel and delicate stamped motifs create a jewellery-like shimmer across classic silhouettes with subtly widened handles. Playful yet refined, this artisanal design blends decorative detailing with everyday practicality, offering a lively contrast to Carrol Boyes’ contemporary flatware.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Holly Birkby</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel Flatware</p><p><a href=\"/collections/aster\" title=\"Aster\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_HdEyjy": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_auraa6fcb5ea91bcd12ed407fefa06edec12d33e9989d9d09138bdd870d5f41289c6_3_962f8e4a-3cb0-4edf-b58d-9563fbac9d23.webp",
            "title": "Aura",
            "text": "<p>An expression of true craftsmanship, the Aura glassware range is mouth-blown and hand-finished by our skilled artisans. Synonymous with this traditional crafting process, each glass has a personal and unique touch. The Aura range includes Champagne Flutes, Drinking Glasses, and Wine Glasses.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Glass</p><p><a href=\"/collections/aura\" title=\"Aura\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_QPwHyX": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/BestSellers_Baobab.png",
            "title": "Baobab",
            "text": "<p>Widely revered by avid collectors, the Baobab glassware range is hand blown by highly skilled artisans. Inspired by the plump trunk of the African Baobab tree, Carrol designed this range with an emphasis on solid stems that mimic the unique characteristics of the Baobab tree.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Mouth Blown Glass</p><p><a href=\"/collections/baobab\" title=\"Baobab\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_ALpBQ7": {
          "type": "card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_BRUSHSTROKES.png",
            "title": "Brushstrokes",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the expressive flow of a painter’s hand, the Brush Strokes Collection pairs bold sophistication with relaxed modernism. Its fresh, poetic scent—rose, jasmine, violets and green, mossy notes—evokes a garden after rain. From soaps and lotions to body creams and diffusers, each product elevates daily rituals with serene, artful packaging that reflects Carrol Boyes’ creative spirit.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Fragrance</p><p><a href=\"/collections/brushstrokes\" title=\"Brushstrokes\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_QEECVK": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_June_Connoiseur_wine_glass_and_buffalo_bottle_stopper_2.jpg",
            "title": "Buffalo",
            "text": "<p>Celebrating the strength of African wildlife, the Buffalo sculpture captures the powerful form of the buffalo in sculptural detail. Crafted from chrome-plated zinc with a polished stainless-steel base, each piece reflects light like a small artwork. Bold and symbolic, the design brings character to bar carts and tabletops, offering practical function and meaningful African-inspired craftsmanship.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Greg Visagie</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/products/bottle-stopper-buffalo\" title=\"Bottle Stopper - Buffalo\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_PJXa9A": {
          "type": "card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Catwalk Girls",
            "text": "<p>Tell your story</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>FOUND IN:</p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_Ymifjc": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Artboard_479.png",
            "title": "Connoisseur",
            "text": "<p>In this landmark glassware range, Carrol’s beloved sculptural figures feature for the first time. A slender woman holding aloft the bowl of the glass like an offering. These exquisite glasses are the result of hand craftsmanship and modern technology combined, intended to grace the most special of celebrations.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Glass</p><p><a href=\"/collections/connoisseur\" title=\"Connoisseur\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "heading_EtNerL": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "| D - G"
          }
        },
        "card_xhLdXX": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb24_450x450_daffodil_spoons.webp",
            "title": "Daffodil",
            "text": "<p>This fresh and modern interpretation of the sprightly daffodil brings the optimistic flower to your table all year round.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Holly Birkby</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/daffodil\" title=\"Daffodil\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_ttXPBy": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_dancing_girls_450x450_74573689-4be5-4165-af4d-30d52f52140e.webp",
            "title": "Dancing Girls",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the joyful energy and expressive movement of dance, the Dancing Girls Collection captures Carrol Boyes’ iconic dancer motifs in glossy porcelain. Sculptural pieces embody grace, rhythm and creativity, transforming everyday dining into a celebration of art and form - while uniting elegance, function and contemporary charm.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Holly</p><p>Materials: Porcelain</p><p><a href=\"/collections/dancing-girls\" title=\"Dancing Girls\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_8bDLTd": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb24_1080x1080_discussion3_7.webp",
            "title": "Discussion",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by Carrol Boyes’ figurative interpretation of the human form, the Discussion Collection features bold figures in a hieroglyphic-like arrangement. Set<br/>against a sleek backdrop, each piece exudes confidence and artistic expression,<br/>celebrating humanity in conversation and transforming everyday objects into<br/>sculptural statements.<br/></p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials:</p><p><a href=\"/collections/discussion\" title=\"Discussion\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        }
      },
