    "ss_flip_cards_2_iNf79T": {
      "type": "ss-flip-cards-2",
      "blocks": {
        "card_UwYMGC": {
          "type": "card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_dancing_girls_450x450_74573689-4be5-4165-af4d-30d52f52140e.webp",
            "title": "Dancing Girls",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the joyful energy and expressive movement of dance, the Dancing Girls Collection captures Carrol Boyes’ iconic dancer motifs in glossy porcelain. Sculptural pieces embody grace, rhythm and creativity, transforming everyday dining into a celebration of art and form - while uniting elegance, function and contemporary charm.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Holly</p><p>Materials: Porcelain</p><p><a href=\"/collections/dancing-girls\" title=\"Dancing Girls\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_NJr7xe": {
          "type": "card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb24_1080x1080_discussion3_7.webp",
            "title": "Discussion",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by Carrol Boyes’ figurative interpretation of the human form, the Discussion Collection features bold figures in a hieroglyphic-like arrangement. Set<br/>against a sleek backdrop, each piece exudes confidence and artistic expression,<br/>celebrating humanity in conversation and transforming everyday objects into<br/>sculptural statements.<br/></p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials:</p><p><a href=\"/collections/discussion\" title=\"Discussion\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_7XCjBe": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_JUNE_UTENSILS_DIVER.png",
            "title": "Diver",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by movement, grace and courage, the Diver Collection captures Carrol Boyes’ portrayal of the human form in a dynamic diving pose. Reflecting early brand design, each piece embodies elegance and the spirit of diving into new possibilities, transforming everyday items into expressions of strength, motion<br/>and contemporary sophistication.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/diver\" title=\"Diver\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_LUVWqY": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb21_sugarladle_elephant_faceoff_woman.webp",
            "title": "Elephant",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by African wildlife, the Elephant Collection captures the intelligence and majesty of this iconic creature. Each design celebrates nature’s organic radiance, reflecting Carrol Boyes’ connection to South Africa. Symbolising wisdom, strength and prosperity, the collection blends timeless elegance with a modern, understated aesthetic.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer : </p><p>Materials:</p><p><a href=\"/collections/elephant\" title=\"Elephant\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_7YNPYC": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb24_450x450_enigmarange.webp",
            "title": "Enigma",
            "text": "<p>Originally hand-sculpted by Carrol Boyes, the Enigma Collection explores the mystery and beauty of the human form. Inspired by classical sculpture and expressive facial detail, each piece radiates opulence and artistic depth, merging functionality with art to create sculptural statements for décor and tableware.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Porcelain & Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/enigma\" title=\"Enigma\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_B4r83K": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb15_tall_blue_coasters_face-off_bottle-openers_beer_1.webp",
            "title": "Face Off",
            "text": "<p>Playful and sculptural, the Face Off Collection reimagines the human face through Carrol Boyes’ artistic lens. Crafted in mirror-polished stainless steel with select glass, each piece blends abstract motifs with modern elegance. Designed as functional art for desks and contemporary interiors, the collection adds personality and a bold, refined presence to everyday spaces.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/face-off\" title=\"Face Off\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_zHDnxg": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UK_RANGE_1080x1080_18WC-FIG-SET_1.png",
            "title": "Figures",
            "text": "<p>The Figures Collection highlights Carrol Boyes’ love of the human form, turning functional pieces into sculptural accents. Stylised figures - embossed, elongated or built into handles - animate stainless-steel coasters, espresso sets and tabletop accessories. Refined yet playful, the range brings movement, craftsmanship and signature Carrol Boyes character to both daily rituals and modern entertaining.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/figures\" title=\"Figures\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_WfGDDq": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_flowpot.webp",
            "title": "Flow",
            "text": "<p>The Flow Collection blends premium cookware performance with Carrol Boyes’ sculptural aesthetic. Crafted from mirror-polished 18/8 stainless steel, each piece features ergonomic,<br/>finger-inspired handles and a 6.5 mm bonded base for even heating. Tempered glass lids, dishwasher-safe and induction-ready design ensures versatility. With frying pans, saucepans, stock pots and casseroles, Flow moves effortlessly from stovetop to table.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel Cookware</p><p><a href=\"/collections/flow\" title=\"Flow\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_FQBbMe": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_Sept-Week6-1080s_1E.png",
            "title": "Gala",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the drape of a woman’s Met Gala gown, the Gala Glassware Collection captures high-fashion drama in glass form. Each mouth-blown piece reveals sculptural<br/>movement and indulgent flair, transforming every toast into an artistic celebration of individuality, craftsmanship and contemporary sophistication.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Holly</p><p>Materials: Glassware (Mouth Blown)</p><p><a href=\"/collections/gala\" title=\"Gala\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
