        "card_HaLCdA": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Artboard_65.jpg",
            "title": "Hummingbird",
            "text": "<p>Delicate and graceful, the Hummingbird Collection captures the beauty of this tiny bird in mid-flight. Crafted from stainless steel, the range includes flatware, barware and office accessories - bringing playful elegance to every setting. Light-hearted and artistic, each piece adds joy, charm and Carrol Boyes’ signature sculptural flair to everyday life.<br/></p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Madelaine Morgan</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/hummingbird\" title=\"Hummingbird\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_Lqhrei": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_Handbags_17.jpg",
            "title": "Iconic Leather Bags",
            "text": "<p>Reimagining Carrol Boyes’ first handbag designs, the Iconic Leather Bags Collection pairs supple full-grain leather with signature metallic hardware. From City Bags and Chain Purses to Phone Pouches and Trifold Wallets, each piece blends sculptural detail, everyday functionality and timeless elegance. Signature hardware<br/>designs like Cradle, Toe Touch, and Diver bring Carrol’s creative legacy to<br/>life in classic black and brown tones.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Caro Boyes</p><p>Materials: Full Grain Leather & Metallic Hardware</p><p><a href=\"/collections/iconic-bag-collection\" title=\"Iconic Bag Collection\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_69ykPU": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_april_may_promo_block_iconic_kitchenware_450x450_-_3.webp",
            "title": "Iconic Pieces",
            "text": "<p>Iconic Pieces Collection presents the range’s flagship tableware, serveware, and décor crafted in premium materials such as cast aluminium, pewter, and stainless steel. Bold in concept and luxurious in finish, each piece carries Carrol’s signature sculptural form and artistic integrity, designed to become heirloom-quality and treasured sculptural artwork centrepieces that spark conversations for homes across generations.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol boyes</p><p>Materials: Cast Aluminium, Pewter & Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/iconic\" title=\"Iconic\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_rmc3E7": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB23_Indigo_blues_450x450_d3c95c6d-c800-49cd-b469-4f7aee65a0fa.jpg",
            "title": "Indigo Blues",
            "text": "<p>Evoking depth, elegance and artistic allure the Indigo Blues Collection, inspired by the Indigo Girls Collection, celebrates Carrol Boyes’ figurative style in deep jewel-toned blues. Crafted from glossy stoneware, each piece reveals a flowing, graceful woman. The lustrous finish and tonal layering bring artistry and sophistication to everyday dining.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stoneware</p><p><a href=\"/collections/indigo-blues\" title=\"Indigo Blues\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_Wbh4Kp": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/rectangular_platter-indigo_girl_cake_fork-hummingbird_outdoor_1.webp",
            "title": "Indigo Girls",
            "text": "<p>Drawing inspiration from North-West African dyes, the Indigo Girls Collection<br/>celebrates culture and craftsmanship. Each piece embodies the artistry of the<br/>Saharan Tuareg people, from flawless dinnerware to exquisite serveware,<br/>creating a sophisticated showcase for your favourite dishes.<br/></p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Ceramic & Serveware</p><p><a href=\"/collections/indigo-girls\" title=\"Indigo Girls\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_nG8FXn": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kaleidoscope_-_platter_round_gp.webp",
            "title": "Kaleidoscope",
            "text": "<p>Vibrant, playful and full of life, the Kaleidoscope Collection celebrates colour and pattern through Carrol Boyes’ artistic lens. Crafted from luminous Fine Bone China, each piece features botanical illustrations and platinum detailing. Inspired by the Sketchbook range, it transforms dining into a joyful, creative<br/>experience.</p>",
