        },
        "card_AHhEfH": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/salad_servers_kiss_beige_green.jpg",
            "title": "Kiss",
            "text": "<p>The Kiss Collection embodies love and connection in simple, elegant form. Iconic pieces crafted from polished stainless-steel hug each other in silhouette, making a radiant statement piece for any table. The pieces represent union with interlocking designs that speak of timeless bonds.<br/></p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/kiss\" title=\"Kiss\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
