            "title": "Lacuna",
            "text": "<p>Reviving a timeless design from Carrol Boyes’ archives, the Lacuna Collection brings mystery and artistic fluidity to life. Representing unfilled spaces, its deep brown design of contemporary shapes combined with open spaces exude richness and heritage, inviting interpretation and personal connection with each piece.<br/></p>",
