            "title": "Leopard",
            "text": "<p>Part of Carrol Boyes’s wildlife-inspired<br/>barware, the Leopard Bottle Stopper captures the elegance of the leopard in<br/>stylised, sculptural form. Mirror-polished stainless steel ensures durability and visual impact while preserving cork-sealed bottles. A striking, collectible gift for wine lovers and design enthusiasts.</p>",
