          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/lily_vase.png",
            "title": "Lily",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the elegance of the calla lily, the Lily Collection captures the flower’s natural grace through fluid, sculptural design. Crafted from cast aluminium in mirror-polish and white powder coat finishes, each piece reflects refined simplicity and serene beauty. From decorative vases to minimalist serveware, the collection embodies form and fluidity, bringing a touch of organic sophistication to any space or dining setting.</p>",
