            "title": "Liquid",
            "text": "<p>Flowing lines and sculptural contours define the Liquid Collection, where molten metal meets modern design. Inspired by mercury, each piece captures movement and refinement, crafted from high-quality stainless steel. A seamless fusion of form and function, it brings fluid artistry and timeless elegance to every dining occasion.</p>",
