          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB26_LuxeLoungersdinnerware_11.png",
            "title": "Luxe Loungers",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by sketches from Carrol’s personal archive, the Luxe Loungers Collection features contemporary line drawings of a woman at rest. Each stackable mug is rendered in soft earthy hues with a whisper of blush, designed to harmonize as a set while celebrating individual artistry.</p>",
