            "title": "New Leaf",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the delicate resilience of nature, the New Leaf Collection transforms a simple leaf into functional, sculptural design. Crafted from stainless steel and pewter, the pieces bring elegance and organic beauty to everyday life. Refined and playful, this collection celebrates nature’s forms with contemporary artistry.</p>",
