            "title": "Open Minded",
            "text": "<p>Breaking away from convention, the Open Minded Collection inspires creativity and fresh perspective. Featuring sculptural pieces in glossy porcelain, each piece highlights Carrol Boyes’ signature facial forms. Bold and imaginative, this collection brings artistic flair and contemporary elegance to modern living spaces.</p>",
