            "title": "Revolution",
            "text": "<p>The Revolution Collection captures perpetual movement in sleek, sculptural form. Its polished, laser-cut stainless steel designs reflect Carrol Boyes’ signature creativity and craftsmanship. Elegant and functional, the pieces combine style and innovation - making every accessory a statement of contemporary design.</p>",
