            "title": "Sketchbook",
            "text": "<p>Featuring Carrol’s personal sketchbook drawings, the Sketchbook Collection celebrates her fascination with the human form and people-watching in Parisian cafés. Each piece transforms spontaneous line work into elegant, functional art, with fluid black drawings on a crisp white canvas that inspire conversation at the table.</p>",
