            "title": "Sketchbook Black",
            "text": "<p>Characterized by white line drawings on black porcelain, Sketchbook Black reimagines Carrol’s original sketches in a modern palette. Elegant and striking, it transforms everyday dining into a sophisticated visual statement while sparking conversation and celebrating expressive form.</p>",
