            "title": "Sketchbook Grey",
            "text": "<p>Evoking a relaxed, contemporary sensibility, the Sketchbook Grey Collection features dove grey linework on a milk-white surface. Each plate carries a unique expression and mood, combining individuality with fine porcelain craftsmanship for calm, refined table settings.</p>",
