          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/soul_mates_salad_servers.webp",
            "title": "Soul Mates",
            "text": "<p>An iconic expression of connection and artistry, the Soul Mates Collection features Carrol Boyes’ signature salad servers in polished stainless steel. One of her earliest designs, this sculptural duo - formed as a contemporary couple - combines function with timeless elegance. Perfect for serving salads or side dishes, these radiant pieces bring charm, craftsmanship and a touch of romance to every table.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/soul-mates\" title=\"Soul Mates\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
