            "title": "Succulent Faces",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the African landscape, the Succulent Faces Collection celebrates the harmony of nature and the human form. Each design juxtaposes a feminine face with expressive succulents, suitable for both monochromatic and vibrant table settings. Every piece is unique, reflecting Carrol Boyes’ attention to detail and sculptural artistry.</p>",
