          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_JUNE_SWAY.png",
            "title": "Sway",
            "text": "<p>Drawing inspiration from the elegance of the Peace Lily, the Sway Glassware Collection’s sculptural shape flows from stem to bulb with a slanted rim. Crafted with a generous angular bowl tapering to a fine rim, each lead-free crystal glass is hand-blown to enhance aromas and elevate every drink.</p>",
