        },
        "card_xqcPqU": {
          "type": "card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/swell.jpg",
            "title": "Swell",
            "text": "<p>The Swell Collection brings Carrol Boyes’ artistic wave motif to accessories and lifestyle pieces. Leather bags and stationery capture fluid motion and functional elegance. The collection combines everyday utility with a distinctive, design-led aesthetic. Perfect for gifting or elevating daily routines, Swell balances soft functionalism, quality materials, and a signature artistic touch.</p>",
