          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/tulip.jpg",
            "title": "Tulip",
            "text": "<p>As graceful as the flower that inspired it, the Tulip Glassware Collection<br/>captures the artistry of nature in glass form. Hand-blown from lead-free<br/>crystal, each piece features softly contoured petal curves and an elongated stem, creating a refined silhouette that elevates every pour.</p>",
