          }
        },
        "card_tDUc9C": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Artboard_4.jpg",
            "title": "Take The Plunge",
            "text": "<p>The Coffee Plunger - Take the Plunge transforms a daily coffee ritual into an iconic tabletop moment. Featuring a clear glass vessel paired with a stainless-steel plunger and distinctive Carrol Boyes detailing, this piece balances functionality with refined design - perfect for slow mornings, considered entertaining and thoughtful gifting.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/products/coffee-plunger-take-the-plunge\" title=\"Coffee Plunger - Take The Plunge\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_pBMk9t": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Tipsy_bottle_stopper_pink.jpg",
            "title": "Tipsy",
            "text": "<p>Playful and sculptural, the Tipsy Bottle Stopper features an off-balance human figure in stainless steel and chrome-plated zinc. Mirror-polished for shine, it preserves cork-sealed bottles while adding whimsical charm. A fun, collectible gift for wine lovers and admirers of Carrol Boyes’ imaginative design.</p>",
