            "products": []
          }
        },
        "card_QVq8ct": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_Handbags_24_2841ca54-b799-4351-bf18-5a1195399a3f.png",
            "title": "Toe Touch",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the fluid elegance of Carrol Boyes’ original sculptures, the Toe Touch Collection embodies balance, movement and quiet strength. Featuring sculptural<br/>forms that capture poise and presence, each piece celebrates Carrol’s belief that art should live in motion. Graceful and grounded, Toe Touch brings expressive energy and timeless sophistication to contemporary design.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol boyes</p><p>Materials: Contemporary Decor</p><p><a href=\"/collections/toe-touch\" title=\"Toe Touch\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
