          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/uplifting.jpg",
            "title": "Uplifted",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the human form, the Uplifted Collection transforms a simple corkscrew into an elegant, functional work of art. Crafted from polished chrome-plated alloy and stainless steel, its ergonomic design combines practicality with sculptural sophistication. Effortless to use and visually striking, Uplifted brings both style and joy to everyday moments.</p>",
            "found_text": "<p>Designer: Carrol Boyes</p><p>Materials: Chrome Plated Alloy & Stainless Steel</p><p><a href=\"/collections/uplifted\" title=\"Uplifted\">Shop The Range</a></p>",
