            "title": "Wave",
            "text": "<p>The Wave Collection combines Carrol Boyes’ signature elegance with sculptural forms inspired by the ocean. Crafted in stainless steel, each piece merges functionality with fluid, artistic design - bringing a contemporary, sculptural touch to everyday dining and décor.</p>",
