        "card_6VkEW3": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_wavy_3.webp",
            "title": "Wavy",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by the rhythmic flow of water, the Wavy Collection of ceramic dinnerware, serveware, and glassware embodies Carrol Boyes’ signature fusion of art and<br/>function. Sculptural, fluid forms with softly undulating edges bring movement and serenity to the table, transforming everyday dining into an elegant, expressive experience.</p>",
