          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cb23_augsept_wound_up_offer_450x450_2_1_aabe5f9c-7f21-442c-b620-74c3197d52f8.webp",
            "title": "Wound Up",
            "text": "<p>Inspired by Carrol Boyes’ love of fluid movement and sculptural form, the Wound-Up Collection features organic spirals that bend and flow with graceful unpredictability. Each surface captures and reflects light in motion, creating a dynamic sense of energy. Functional yet artistic, this collection transforms everyday design into a celebration of rhythm, movement and contemporary elegance.</p>",
