          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CB25_Handbags_50.png",
            "title": "Woven Luxury Bags",
            "text": "<p>Tell your story Caro Boyes’ debut handbag collection blends tradition with contemporary design. Crafted from woven polyester with leather accents, each piece features patterns inspired by Carrol Boyes’ archival artwork and new designs by Caro. From chic evening bags to spacious totes, the collection combines artistry, function and South African-inspired elegance for modern, stylish living.</p>",
