            "text": "<p>The Woman Man Collection celebrates the harmony between strength and grace, uniting robust masculine forms with delicate feminine curves. Expressing the bond of humankind through sculptural design, each piece embodies balance and unity. Crafted with Carrol Boyes’ signature artistry, the collection transforms tableware and décor into timeless expressions of form and connection.</p>",
